-- ============================================================================
-- TalentMatch demo seed data — ALL PEOPLE, COMPANIES AND RESUMES ARE FICTIONAL.
-- Email domains use the reserved '.example' TLD so they can never be real.
--
-- Demo password for every account: TalentMatch@2026  (local development only)
-- Only its bcrypt hash (cost 10) is stored below — never the plaintext.
--
-- Idempotent: safe to run more than once (ON CONFLICT / NOT EXISTS guards).
-- IDs are generated by the database, so rows are linked by natural keys
-- (email, company name, job title, skill name) using joins and subqueries.
--
-- match_score is intentionally left NULL: it will be computed from real
-- embeddings with cosine similarity in the embeddings stage.
-- ============================================================================

